          ],
          "content": "Exploring Some Geometric Themes"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.089,
            0.847,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "There are multiple types of prisms and pyramids, whose names depend on the shapes of their faces."
